sentences.text:
Let the applicant Momina @ Choti involved in Case Crime No. 1026 of 2022, under Sections 498A,
304-B IPC and Section 3/4 D.P. Act, Police Station Loni, District Ghaziabad, be released on bail on her furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions;
(i) The applicant shall file an undertaking to the effect that she shall not seek any adjournment on the dates fixed for evidence when the witnesses are present in court.

